{"seq":1,"slug":"security-policy","title":"大学信息管理 — 信息安全策略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/information-management/information-security/security-policy","wordCount":2365,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学信息管理-信息安全策略\">大学信息管理 — 信息安全策略</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>信息安全策略（Information Security Policy）是组织为保护信息资产的机密性、完整性和可用性（CIA 三元组）而制定的系统性规则、标准和程序的集合。ISO/IEC 27001 将信息安全管理体系（ISMS）定义为&quot;通过建立、实施、运行、监视、评审、维护和改进信息安全来管理和控制信息安全风险的系统方法&quot;——信息安全策略是 ISMS 的顶层设计文件。</p>\n<p>CIA 三元组是信息安全的基石概念：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>英文</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>被破坏时的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>机密性</td>\n<td>Confidentiality</td>\n<td>确保信息仅对授权人员可访问</td>\n<td>数据泄露、商业秘密外泄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整性</td>\n<td>Integrity</td>\n<td>确保信息未被未授权修改或破坏</td>\n<td>财务数据篡改、系统配置被改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用性</td>\n<td>Availability</td>\n<td>确保授权用户能在需要时访问信息</td>\n<td>系统宕机、服务中断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>信息安全的根本挑战是：安全不是一种技术产品，而是一种持续的管理过程。Bruce Schneier 的名言&quot;安全是一个过程，不是一个产品&quot;（Security is a process, not a product）指出了关键——再精密的防火墙也无法保护一个员工随手写在便利贴上的密码。信息安全策略的目的正是建立组织层面的安全意识、规则和流程，将安全从技术问题提升为管理问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-信息安全管理体系-isms\">一、信息安全管理体系（ISMS）</h3><p>ISO/IEC 27001 是全球最广泛采用的信息安全管理标准。它基于 PDCA（Plan-Do-Check-Act）循环构建持续改进的安全管理体系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Plan 规划&lt;br/&gt;建立安全策略和目标] --&gt; B[Do 实施&lt;br/&gt;执行安全控制措施]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Check 检查&lt;br/&gt;监控和评审安全状态]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Act 改进&lt;br/&gt;纠正偏差持续优化]&#10;    D --&gt; A&#10;\">graph TD\n    A[Plan 规划&lt;br/&gt;建立安全策略和目标] --&gt; B[Do 实施&lt;br/&gt;执行安全控制措施]\n    B --&gt; C[Check 检查&lt;br/&gt;监控和评审安全状态]\n    C --&gt; D[Act 改进&lt;br/&gt;纠正偏差持续优化]\n    D --&gt; A\n</pre><p>ISO 27001 附录 A 定义了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> 个安全控制域（2022 版重组为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 大主题 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>93</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">93</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">93</span></span></span></span></span> 项控制）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>控制项数</th>\n<th>典型控制措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组织控制</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>37</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">37</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>安全策略、职责分工、资产管理、供应商管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人员控制</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>背景审查、安全意识培训、离职处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理控制</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>物理访问控制、设备保护、安全区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术控制</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>34</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">34</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">34</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>访问控制、加密、日志审计、漏洞管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"二-安全策略的层次结构\">二、安全策略的层次结构</h3><p>信息安全策略不是一份单一文件，而是一个层次化的文档体系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>文档类型</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>批准者</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一层</td>\n<td>安全方针（Policy）</td>\n<td>组织对安全的总体承诺和方向</td>\n<td>CEO/董事会</td>\n<td>每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二层</td>\n<td>安全标准（Standard）</td>\n<td>特定领域的强制性要求</td>\n<td>CISO</td>\n<td>每年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三层</td>\n<td>安全指南（Guideline）</td>\n<td>推荐的最佳实践</td>\n<td>安全团队</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第四层</td>\n<td>操作规程（Procedure）</td>\n<td>具体操作步骤</td>\n<td>运维团队</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>安全方针</strong>是最高层文件，通常只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 页，声明组织对信息安全的立场和承诺。它应由最高管理层签署，体现&quot;自上而下&quot;的安全治理原则。</p>\n<p><strong>安全标准</strong>将方针具体化为可度量的要求。例如&quot;密码策略标准&quot;可能规定：密码最小长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 字符，必须包含大小写字母、数字和特殊字符，每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90</span></span></span></span></span> 天更换一次，最近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 次密码不可重复使用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-风险管理框架\">三、风险管理框架</h3><p>信息安全的核心方法论是风险管理——安全投入不是越多越好，而是要在安全成本和风险损失之间找到最优平衡点。</p>\n<p>风险评估的基本公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>风险</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>威胁</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>脆弱性</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>资产价值</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{风险} = \\text{威胁} \\times \\text{脆弱性} \\times \\text{资产价值}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">风险</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">威胁</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">脆弱性</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">资产价值</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>更精确的年化损失期望（ALE）计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ALE = SLE \\times ARO</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SLE</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>（Single Loss Expectancy）= 资产价值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 暴露因子（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ARO</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>（Annualized Rate of Occurrence）= 威胁事件的年发生概率。</p>\n<p>风险处置的四种策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>降低（Mitigate）</td>\n<td>实施控制措施减少风险</td>\n<td>风险可控且成本合理</td>\n<td>部署入侵检测系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转移（Transfer）</td>\n<td>将风险转移给第三方</td>\n<td>残余风险超出自身承受能力</td>\n<td>购买网络安全保险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接受（Accept）</td>\n<td>明确知悉并接受风险</td>\n<td>风险很低或控制成本过高</td>\n<td>低敏感系统不加密</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规避（Avoid）</td>\n<td>放弃产生风险的活动</td>\n<td>风险极高且无有效控制</td>\n<td>不收集不必要的敏感数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>安全投资的最优点在 Gordon-Loeb 模型中有数学表达：最优安全投资不应超过预期损失的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>e</mi></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>37</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{e} \\approx 37\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mi>e</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^* \\leq \\frac{ALE}{e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8747em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"四-访问控制模型\">四、访问控制模型</h3><p>访问控制是信息安全策略执行的核心技术机制。经典的访问控制模型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>核心原则</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DAC</td>\n<td>自主访问控制</td>\n<td>资源所有者决定谁能访问</td>\n<td>文件系统权限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAC</td>\n<td>强制访问控制</td>\n<td>系统根据安全标签强制执行</td>\n<td>军事/政府系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RBAC</td>\n<td>基于角色的访问控制</td>\n<td>通过角色间接授权</td>\n<td>企业信息系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ABAC</td>\n<td>基于属性的访问控制</td>\n<td>根据用户/资源/环境属性动态授权</td>\n<td>云计算环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>RBAC 是企业环境中最广泛使用的模型。其核心思想是将权限赋予角色而非个人——用户通过获得角色来间接获取权限。RBAC 的数学表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>用户</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>分配</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>角色</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>授权</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>权限</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{用户} \\xrightarrow{\\text{分配}} \\text{角色} \\xrightarrow{\\text{授权}} \\text{权限}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">用户</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">分配</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">角色</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">授权</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">权限</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最小权限原则（Principle of Least Privilege）要求每个用户只获得完成工作所需的最小权限集。职责分离（Separation of Duties, SoD）要求关键业务流程的不同环节由不同人员执行——如发起付款和审批付款不能是同一个人。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-安全事件响应\">五、安全事件响应</h3><p>再完善的预防措施也无法完全避免安全事件。安全事件响应计划（Incident Response Plan, IRP）定义了事件发生后的应对流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[准备&lt;br/&gt;Preparation] --&gt; B[检测与分析&lt;br/&gt;Detection]&#10;    B --&gt; C[遏制&lt;br/&gt;Containment]&#10;    C --&gt; D[根除&lt;br/&gt;Eradication]&#10;    D --&gt; E[恢复&lt;br/&gt;Recovery]&#10;    E --&gt; F[复盘&lt;br/&gt;Lessons Learned]&#10;    F -.-&gt; A\">flowchart LR\n    A[准备&lt;br/&gt;Preparation] --&gt; B[检测与分析&lt;br/&gt;Detection]\n    B --&gt; C[遏制&lt;br/&gt;Containment]\n    C --&gt; D[根除&lt;br/&gt;Eradication]\n    D --&gt; E[恢复&lt;br/&gt;Recovery]\n    E --&gt; F[复盘&lt;br/&gt;Lessons Learned]\n    F -.-&gt; A</pre><p>NIST SP 800-61 是安全事件响应的权威指南。关键要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>准备阶段</strong>：建立响应团队（CSIRT）、配备工具和通信渠道、制定分级标准</li>\n<li><strong>检测与分析</strong>：确认事件真实性、评估影响范围和严重程度</li>\n<li><strong>遏制</strong>：短期遏制（如隔离受感染主机）和长期遏制（如修补漏洞）</li>\n<li><strong>根除与恢复</strong>：彻底清除威胁、从可信备份恢复系统</li>\n<li><strong>复盘</strong>：分析根因、更新策略和流程——这一步最容易被忽略，但最有价值</li>\n</ul>\n<p>安全事件的分级通常采用四级模型：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（Critical，系统大规模瘫痪或敏感数据大量泄露）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>（High，核心业务受影响）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>（Medium，非核心系统受影响）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>（Low，个别用户受影响）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>CIA 分析</strong>：分析以下系统对 CIA 三个属性的优先级排序：(a) 网上银行，(b) 医院电子病历，(c) 新闻网站，(d) 核电站控制系统。解释你的排序理由。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>风险评估</strong>：某公司有一台服务器存储客户数据，资产价值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> 万元。遭受数据泄露的暴露因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span>，年发生概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SLE</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ALE</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>。如果一套数据加密方案成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 万元/年，能将暴露因子降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>，是否值得投资？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>策略编写</strong>：为你所在大学的学生信息系统编写一份密码策略标准（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 页以内），包括：密码复杂度要求、更换周期、禁止行为和违规处罚。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>RBAC 设计</strong>：为一个在线教育平台设计 RBAC 模型，至少包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 个角色（学生、教师、课程管理员、系统管理员），为每个角色定义 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 项权限，并识别需要职责分离的操作对。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>事件响应演练</strong>：假设你所在大学的教务系统被勒索软件攻击，所有成绩数据被加密，攻击者要求支付 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 比特币赎金。按 NIST 六步模型，详细描述你作为安全响应负责人会采取的行动。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>国际标准</strong>：ISO/IEC 27001:2022 和 ISO/IEC 27002:2022——信息安全管理体系的全球标准，任何信息安全从业者的必读文件</li>\n<li><strong>风险管理</strong>：NIST SP 800-30《Risk Management Guide for Information Technology Systems》——美国国家标准与技术研究院的风险管理权威指南</li>\n<li><strong>事件响应</strong>：NIST SP 800-61《Computer Security Incident Handling Guide》——安全事件响应的实操手册</li>\n<li><strong>中国标准</strong>：GB/T 22080-2016（等同采用 ISO 27001）和网络安全等级保护 2.0（&quot;等保 2.0&quot;）——了解中国信息安全的法规框架</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>信息安全策略是组织保护信息资产的顶层设计，其核心是围绕 CIA 三元组建立系统化的管理框架。ISO 27001 提供了 ISMS 的国际标准，风险管理方法论帮助组织在安全投入和风险损失之间找到最优平衡。访问控制模型（特别是 RBAC）是策略执行的核心技术机制，最小权限和职责分离原则是基本准则。安全事件响应计划确保组织在事件发生后能快速、有序地应对。信息安全不是一次性工程，而是持续改进的 PDCA 循环。建议接下来学习隐私保护，理解信息安全策略在个人数据保护领域的延伸。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学信息管理 — 信息安全策略","id":"大学信息管理-信息安全策略"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、信息安全管理体系（ISMS）","id":"一-信息安全管理体系-isms"},{"level":3,"text":"二、安全策略的层次结构","id":"二-安全策略的层次结构"},{"level":3,"text":"三、风险管理框架","id":"三-风险管理框架"},{"level":3,"text":"四、访问控制模型","id":"四-访问控制模型"},{"level":3,"text":"五、安全事件响应","id":"五-安全事件响应"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学信息管理 — 组织学习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/information-management/knowledge-management/organizational-learning"},"next":{"title":"隐私保护与数据合规","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/information-management/information-security/privacy-protection"}}